## 1. Purpose and scope

This document states the requirements for using {{tool_name}} ({{vendor}}) in the intended use defined in {{doc_id_01}}. Each requirement states a condition that the code host, the tool configuration, the identities and the records must meet, whichever model produced the output, so that the tool's output cannot reach the product or the QMS without qualified human control.

Every requirement is testable, is traced to the tests in {{doc_id_05}} and to the risks in {{doc_id_03}}, and applies to every in-scope surface ({{#surfaces}}`{{.}}` {{/surfaces}}) and to every model in the approved envelope. A requirement marked "Not applicable" keeps its ID so that traceability stays complete; the reason is stated.

