### REQ-07 Local guardrails behave as configured

{{#surf_local_cli_ide}}
Applies: the local CLI / IDE surface is in scope.
{{/surf_local_cli_ide}}
{{^surf_local_cli_ide}}
{{#surf_ci_headless}}
